      "guide.reply.soon":"Hmmm.. I might be able to respond to your input soon. For now, there's not much I can say about that. But don't worry! You can learn more by browsing deeper into the website and scanning more artifacts. Have fun exploring! 💚",
      "guide.reply.hello":"Hey! I’m Pat Riotik, your friendly site guide. Ask me about the Presidents’ Memorabilia, AEA-IRC, Live Scan, the Knowledge Graph, or what’s on this home page—happy to share what I know. 💚",
